# Mutations for mutate.py. Each one swaps a piece of JoiningThreadPool.tla for
# a plausible bug and names the one property that must fail on it. The text
# after `- ` must occur exactly once in the spec; `+ ` lines replace it. An
# optional `only <label-substring>` line limits the matrix runs. Every property
# the matrix checks needs a mutation.

mutation settling a callable does not notify the waiting shutdown
detects BlockingReturns
only workers=2 items=3 mode=normal
- /\ main' = Wake(main)
+ /\ main' = main

mutation shutdown cancels queued futures without removing their tokens
detects BlockingReturns
only workers=2 items=3 mode=cancel
-                       /\ outstanding' = {j \in outstanding : state[j] = "running"}
-                       /\ state' = [j \in J |-> IF state[j] = "pending" THEN "settled" ELSE state[j]]
+                       /\ UNCHANGED tokens

mutation a wakeup returns from the wait without rechecking the tokens
detects NoLeak
only workers=2 items=3 mode=normal
- SpuriousWake == main = "wait" /\ MainGoes("drain-lock")
+ SpuriousWake == main = "wait" /\ MainGoes("join")

mutation a failed submit leaves its token in place
detects TokensExact
only workers=2 items=3 mode=submit-error
- /\ outstanding' = outstanding \ {cancelJob}
+ /\ outstanding' = outstanding

mutation shutdown clears the tokens of running callables too
detects TokensExact
only workers=2 items=3 mode=cancel
- /\ outstanding' = {j \in outstanding : state[j] = "running"}
+ /\ outstanding' = {}

mutation a failed submit removes a token that a worker already owns
detects BorrowedRunning
only workers=2 items=3 mode=submit-error
- /\ IF state[cancelJob] = "pending"
+ /\ IF TRUE

mutation a worker runs a wrapper whose token was removed
detects TokensExact
only workers=2 items=3 mode=submit-error
- /\ IF state[job[w]] = "settled"
+ /\ IF FALSE

mutation the job counter advances by two
detects TypeOK
only workers=2 items=1 mode=normal
- nextJob' = nextJob + 1
+ nextJob' = nextJob + 2

mutation a worker takes a job without removing it from the queue
detects Ownership
only workers=2 items=3 mode=normal
- /\ queue' = Tail(queue)
+ /\ queue' = queue

mutation a worker borrows a cancelled job's arguments after shutdown returned
detects NoBorrowAfterRelease
only workers=2 items=3 mode=cancel
- /\ IF state[job[w]] = "settled"
+ /\ IF FALSE

mutation join never returns
detects NoCloseTerminates
only workers=2 items=3 mode=normal
- Join == /\ main = "join" /\ main' = "closed"
+ Join == /\ main = "join" /\ main' = "join"
